{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/76230-2-5-errata-as-comments","id":76230,"title":"2.5 Errata as comments","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-02-21T06:32:26-08:00","id":76230,"title":"2.5 Errata as comments","content":"Old post - outdated links. New ones in a new post, once it gets Approved (SO MANY LINKS!)<br /> <br /> Had a friend asking me for these recently, and I realised that thanks to the death of the old forums, and the archive not having everything available, the only up to date version of this was buried several pages deep into an RPG.net page. And since people are still playing 2.5 games, I figure it's still useful to have this available. I've also included at the end the cross-reference comments I made for the core book, which give you the stat prereqs, and a quick (rules-free) description of the effects of every Solar charm that's not in the core book, which book they are in, and show how they extend the core charm trees.<br /> <br /> These were all made using Foxit PDF reader, and thus that's what I have the most experience in doing stuff with them in. In that, go to the comments menu/tab, and look for 'Import comments' or 'Import comments data' (wording appears to be different in different versions). Import the comments into the file, then save the file. Done.<br /> <br /> If you're not using Foxit Reader, then the general approach that seems to work is opening the .fdf file itself, which will then ask what PDF you want to apply it to. Pick the right one, save, done. Alternative, it should also work if you download foxit just for applying the comments, save them all, then open the files in whatever your usual PDF reader is. <hr /><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Main/original versions</span></b><br /> (That which I've made originally, using my copies of the PDFs, in most cases best to download these, then if they don't match up look for an alternate version)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://dl.dropbox.com/u/7383734/erratacomments/erratacomments_core_may2012.fdf\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Second Edition Core</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://dl.dropbox.com/u/7383734/erratacomments/erratacomments_dragonblooded_may2012.fdf\" target=\"_blank\">Manual of Exalted Power: Dragonblooded</a><br /> <a href=\"http://dl.dropbox.com/u/7383734/erratacomments/erratacomments_lunars_may2012.fdf\" target=\"_blank\">Manual of Exalted Power: Lunars</a><br /> <a href=\"http://dl.dropbox.com/u/7383734/erratacomments/erratacomments_sidereals_june2012.fdf\" target=\"_blank\">Manual of Exalted Power: Sidereals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://dl.dropbox.com/u/7383734/erratacomments/erratacomments_abyssals_may2012.fdf\" target=\"_blank\">Manual of Exalted Power: Abyssals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://dl.dropbox.com/u/7383734/erratacomments/erratacomments_infernals_may2012.fdf\" target=\"_blank\">Manual of Exalted Power: Infernals</a><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"><a href=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/7383734/erratacomments/erratacomments_infernals_thedementedone_may2014.FDF\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's extra errata for Infernals</a>. Taken from <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/124885-how-to-put-a-band-aid-on-infernals?p=128384#post128384\">this post</a>.</div> <br /> <a href=\"http://dl.dropbox.com/u/7383734/erratacomments/erratacomments_alchemicals_may2012.fdf\" target=\"_blank\">Manual of Exalted Power: Alchemicals</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://dl.dropbox.com/u/7383734/erratacomments/erratacomments_raksha_june2012.fdf\" target=\"_blank\">Graceful Wicked Masques: The Fair Folk</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://dl.dropbox.com/u/7383734/erratacomments/erratacomments_gloriesunconqueredsun_may2012.fdf\" target=\"_blank\">Glories of the Most High: Unconquered Sun</a><br /> <a href=\"http://dl.dropbox.com/u/7383734/erratacomments/erratacomments_gloriesluna_may2012.fdf\" t