ox.com/u/7383734/erratacomments/erratacomments_compasswyld_may2012.fdf\" target=\"_blank\">Compass of Celestial Directions: The Wyld</a> <hr /><br /> <br /> <b><a href=\"http://dl.dropbox.com/u/7383734/erratacomments/erratacomments_june2012.zip\" target=\"_blank\">All the errata above in one zip file</a> </b> (includes the alternate versions below) <hr /><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:24px\"><b>Alternate Versions</b></span><br /> (If you apply the errata to your PDF, and they all come out one or several pages forwards or backwards of what it should be, then have a look at these)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://dl.dropbox.com/u/7383734/erratacomments/erratacomments_core_may2012_hyperlinkedcore.fdf\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Second Edition Core</a> \u2014 all comments moved forwards three pages (for the most recent version of the Core, the one that has hyperlinks and so forth in it)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://dl.dropbox.com/u/7383734/erratacomments/erratacomments_dragonblooded_may2012_plusone.fdf\" target=\"_blank\">Manual of Exalted Power: Dragonblooded</a> \u2014 all comments moved forwards one page.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://dl.dropbox.com/u/7383734/erratacomments/erratacomments_lunars_may2012_plusone.fdf\" target=\"_blank\">Manual of Exalted Power: Lunars</a> \u2014 all comments moved forwards one page.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://dl.dropbox.com/u/7383734/erratacomments/erratacomments_sidereals_june2012_plusone.fdf\" target=\"_blank\">Manual of Exalted Power: Sidereals</a> \u2014 All comments moved forwards one page.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://dl.dropbox.com/u/7383734/erratacomments/erratacomments_abyssals_may2012_plusone.fdf\" target=\"_blank\">Manual of Exalted Power: Abyssals</a> \u2014 all comments moved forwards one page.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://dl.dropbox.com/u/7383734/erratacomments/erratacomments_infernals_may2012_minusone.fdf\" target=\"_blank\">Manual of Exalted Power:Infernals</a> \u2014 all comments moved backwards one page. <hr /><br /> <span style=\"font-size:24px\"><b>Cross Reference Comments</b></span><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/7383734/crossreference/crossreference_2e_core_november2012.fdf\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Second Edition Core</a><br /> <br /> Haven't done any more of the cross references, due to a lack of time, not needing them myself, and not seeing a huge amount of demand for them. But given they'll be much easier to do alongside the third edition line itself, just adding them whenever a non-core book has new charms for a splat, I'm planning to do them for 3E when it gets that far. And whatever (hopefully minor) errata 3E has.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":30,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/30-fearmeforiampink","user":"FearMeForIAmPink","date":".  Marking this as the old version 09-08-2024, 09:12 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":18}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/30-fearmeforiampink","name":"FearMeForIAmPink","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar30_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-21T08:26:28-08:00","id":76291,"title":"","content":"Thanks for those","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1609-fumble","name":"Fumble","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1609_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-21T09:13:03-08:00","id":76323,"title":"","content":"A fine service to the community. Many thanks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/698-chalicier","name":"chalicier","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"146"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-22T14:12:21-08:00","id":77305,"title":"","content":"FearMeForIAmPink,<br /> <br /> Thank you!!! I have download and applied these. They look GREAT!!! Don't know how long this took you, but you're time and effort is very much appreciated!!! Now I don't have to switch between multiple documents.<br /> <br /> Thank you. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> ~ N","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;There is timing in everything. Timing in strategy cannot be mastered without a great deal of practice. There is also timing in the Void. You win battles with the timing in the Void born of the timing of cunning by knowing the enemies' timing, and thus using a timing which the enemy does not expect.&quot; <i>Shinmen Musashi no Kami Fujiwara no Genshin, Go Rin No Sho (The Book of the Five Rings)</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2141-nadrakas","name":"Nadrakas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2141_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"278"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-22T15:32:35-08:00","id":77362,"title":"","content":"Oh yeah, I remember these! Great utility, I can't even tell you. Seriously good work.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-22T16:57:58-08:00","id":77404,"title":"","content":"You remain a gentleman and a scholar.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-25T10:56:44-08:00","id":79447,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nadrakas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/76230-2-5-errata-as-comments?p=77305#post77305\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">FearMeForIAmPink,<br /> <br /> Thank you!!! I have download and applied these. They look GREAT!!! Don't know how long this took you, but you're time and effort is very much appreciated!!! Now I don't have to switch between multiple documents.<br /> <br /> Thank you. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> ~ N</div> </div> </div> </div>Looking back at my IRC logs from where I first mooted the idea, to when I'd gotten enough done to post to the forums, that was about two to three months \u2014 IIRC, that was the core and all the MoEPs, possibly a few other bits and bobs. Then it took about another month or two to get the rest of it done, most of which was doing Graceful Wicked Masques.<br /> <br /> It was annoying at the time, but I make enough use of it myself for it to be worth it on that basis, it was easier than what I briefly started doing (combining charms and errata in a word document), and it was something I could share and have people go &quot;Woo!&quot; about. Overall? Totally worth it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/30-fearmeforiampink","name":"FearMeForIAmPink","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar30_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-25T18:12:45-08:00","id":79803,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FearMeForIAmPink</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/76230-2-5-errata-as-comments?p=79447#post79447\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Looking back at my IRC logs from where I first mooted the idea, to when I'd gotten enough done to post to the forums, that was about two to three months \u2014 IIRC, that was the core and all the MoEPs, possibly a few other bits and bobs. Then it took about another month or two to get the rest of it done, most of which was doing Graceful Wicked Masques.<br /> <br /> It was annoying at the time, but I make enough use of it myself for it to be worth it on that basis, it was easier than what I briefly started doing (combining charms and errata in a word document), and it was something I could share and have people go &quot;Woo!&quot; about. Overall? Totally worth it.</div> </div> </div> </div>And you have made a lot of people very happy out here very appreciative. Again, that you for all of your hard work.<br /> <br /> ~ N","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;There is timing in everything. Timing in strategy cannot be mastered without a great deal of practice. There is also timing in the Void. You win battles with the timing in the Void born of the timing of cunning by knowing the enemies' timing, and thus using a timing which the enemy does not expect.&quot; <i>Shinmen Musashi no Kami Fujiwara no Genshin, Go Rin No Sho (The Book of the Five Rings)</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2141-nadrakas","name":"Nadrakas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2141_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"278"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-25T16:24:10-07:00","id":98754,"title":"","content":"FearMeForIAmPink, <br /> <br /> \u200bTHANK YOU SO MUCH =)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If you like Alchemicals, please check out my DeviantArt Gallery!! <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> - 5 Magic Materials BeamKlaves and Gyroscopic Chakrans ? OK<br /> - Autochthonia updated World Map? OK<br /> And many more! <a href=\"http://efq.deviantart.com/gallery/48131405/Alchemicals\" target=\"_blank\">http://efq.deviantart.com/gallery/48131405/Alchemicals</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2498-yukiartic","name":"Yukiartic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T04:59:48-07:00","id":129804,"title":"","content":"Have added the extra errata recently released for Infernals and the Broken Winged Crane to the list; it's a seperate file and slightly more rushed \u2014 since I was doing them on a 'clean' PDF, checking they didn't hit the Scroll of Errata comments by eye, they're not quite so nicely lined up.<br /> <br /> This errata is done in green stars, so it's distinguishable from the other stuff. I've added the errata to existing charms next to those charms, as I did with the original errata-as-comments, the new charms (that aren't &quot;Replace this charm, even its name) I've added to the charm trees, with arrows distinguishing where they come from (and a dotted arrow to indicate the excellency requirement on one of them).<br /> <br /> If there's a particular demand for it, or people's PDF readers are having trouble applying two errata comments files, then I can make a version that combines this with the original errata comments for Infernals. Otherwise, it just seems easier for people to apply both themselves.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/30-fearmeforiampink","name":"FearMeForIAmPink","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar30_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"",